    "id": "2db2c3d4e5f60001",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "Confirm delivery or alert",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Sends a message, checks 30 seconds later whether it failed, and warns you if it did."
  },
  {
    "id": "2db2c3d4e5f60002",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "2db2c3d4e5f60001",
    "name": "Setup",
    "info": "Before you run this flow: open the Turbo Notify account node, paste an API key and press Test. Your Turbo Notify account needs a WhatsApp number linked to it. The key needs messages:send and messages:read. Replace +12025550123 with the number that should receive the message. Replace the second number (in the function node) with yours: it receives the warning. A message that is still pending or sent after 30 seconds is not a failure (the person may be offline), so only failed raises the warning.",
    "x": 200,
    "y": 40,
    "wires": []
  },
